# Reproducible source builds.
#
# Normalize ALL text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, so that
# the PyPI wheel/sdist and the npm tarball built from a source checkout are
# byte-for-byte identical regardless of the checkout platform's core.autocrlf
# setting (Windows checkouts default to CRLF, which otherwise changes the
# packaged bytes and breaks the reproducible-build guarantee).
* text=auto eol=lf
